# Data sync section
LeadtrackerDataSyncTitle = Data sync
LeadtrackerAmountMode = Lead amount source
LeadtrackerAmountModeManual = Manual (never auto-update)
LeadtrackerAmountModeAuto = Auto — LTV hierarchy
LeadtrackerAmountModeHelp = Auto mode tracks the closest-to-cash figure available: open proposals are averaged until one is accepted, accepted proposals are superseded by validated orders, and orders are superseded by invoices. Multiple invoices and orders accumulate as a running lifetime total.
LeadtrackerAmountExtrafield = Baseline extrafield
LeadtrackerAmountExtrafieldHelp = Attribute code of a numeric project extrafield to use as the initial lead value when no proposals, orders, or invoices exist yet (e.g. an estimate captured at lead intake). Leave empty to disable.
LeadtrackerPercentMode = Probability percentage
LeadtrackerPercentModeManual = Manual (never auto-update)
LeadtrackerPercentModeStageDefault = Auto — follow stage default
LeadtrackerPercentModeHelp = Stage default reads the percentage configured in Home > Setup > Dictionary > Lead status and writes it to the project whenever the stage advances.

# Opportunity filter section
LeadtrackerFilterSectionTitle = Opportunity filter
LeadtrackerFilterUsageNote = Only projects with "Follow opportunity" checked are ever shown in the tracker — that is the primary gate. The category filter below narrows further within that set.
LeadtrackerFilterSectionHelp = Optionally restrict the tracker to a subset of opportunity projects using a project category as a flag. Select "Track all projects" to disable additional filtering.
LeadtrackerFilterMode = Filter mode
LeadtrackerFilterAll = Track all projects
LeadtrackerFilterHasCategory = Track only projects with the selected category
LeadtrackerFilterNoCategory = Ignore projects with the selected category
LeadtrackerFilterCategory = Flag category
LeadtrackerFilterCategoryNone = (none)
LeadtrackerFilterNoCategoriesYet = No project categories found.
LeadtrackerGoToCategories = Create one →

